implementation of deep learning

00:52:39.080 --> 00:52:42.620
models is something
that is a big security

00:52:42.620 --> 00:52:44.120
conversation for you guys.

00:52:44.120 --> 00:52:45.620
You can answer it
yes or no if you'd

00:52:45.620 --> 00:52:49.280
like, just to help move on.

00:52:49.280 --> 00:52:50.750
Yes.

00:52:50.750 --> 00:52:53.180
OK, cool, I figured as much.

00:52:53.180 --> 00:52:54.210
I can say more.

00:52:54.210 --> 00:52:56.270
And by the way, we haven't
