00:52:56.270 --> 00:52:58.250
But AI ethics is
something we're going

00:52:58.250 --> 00:53:00.240
to start working on here
in the city as well.

00:53:00.240 --> 00:53:00.755
Cool.

00:53:00.755 --> 00:53:02.990
I'll follow up with
you on the side maybe

00:53:02.990 --> 00:53:04.785
