01:04:36.780 --> 01:04:41.190
So I am very, very much
inspired by the speakers.

01:04:41.190 --> 01:04:43.960
So I look forward to
joining next week.

01:04:43.960 --> 01:04:45.430
Thank you so much.

01:04:45.430 --> 01:04:47.310
Awesome, thank you
